  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for the following reasons: \r\nThe application site falls within the Article 4 Direction which removes permitted development rights for the change of use from Class E (commercial, business and service) to Class C3 (dwellinghouses) under Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA.\r\nThe applicant has also failed to demonstrate the proposal would not result in conditions prejudicial to highway or pedestrian safety and has failed to demonstrate the proposal would provide an acceptable noise environment for future residents. The proposal is therefore contrary to Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraphs MA.2(2)(a), (d) and (g) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n\r\n"
